[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13202.87, "timestamp": "03:40:02", "text": "明白了。是的。我也是。有时我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13205.99, "timestamp": "03:40:05", "text": "我需要慢慢来。我需要一些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13210.469, "timestamp": "03:40:10", "text": "要慢点才能理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13214.469, "timestamp": "03:40:14", "text": "嗯。是的，这很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13217.99, "timestamp": "03:40:17", "text": "慢，慢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13223.349, "timestamp": "03:40:23", "text": "是的。今天我过得很忙，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13227.59, "timestamp": "03:40:27", "text": "正如大家所知，这是常态。是的。呃，今天是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13232.95, "timestamp": "03:40:32", "text": "也很活泼，因为呃呃通常呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13235.75, "timestamp": "03:40:35", "text": "每当我们……呃，顺便说一下，我也是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.11, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "所以牙医，别搞错什么什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13241.03, "timestamp": "03:40:41", "text": "他为什么老是谈论牙齿，好像在说“别这样”？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13242.79, "timestamp": "03:40:42", "text": "别担心，我是牙医，不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13247.59, "timestamp": "03:40:47", "text": "它。是的。嗯。所以今天，呃，在我的，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13251.83, "timestamp": "03:40:51", "text": "研究所发生的事情是我们通常的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13254.229, "timestamp": "03:40:54", "text": "来来往往，我们看了很多病人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13259.11, "timestamp": "03:40:59", "text": "对，但有趣的是，我们从来不喜欢"}]